Found a bug: the AI’s written explanation for a ticket sometimes contradicted the actual tag it assigned (e.g., saying “medium severity” in the explanation while tagging it “critical” severity).
First fix attempt looked right on paper, but when we tested it this morning with new records, it still wasn’t working — the contradiction was still showing up.
Traced it to the real cause and fixed it properly this afternoon. Re-tested with new records — confirmed working now, explanations match the final tags.
Also cleaned up how records get split into “what happened” vs “how it was fixed” sections — was previously just a rough half-and-half text cut, now it’s clean and accurate.
